/T (\376\377\000c\000B\0002\000\137\0000\0007\000\133\0000\000\135)
/TU (Page 2\056 Low\055Income Certification  \050Individuals and Sole Proprietors Only\051\056 Do you qualify for Low\055Income Certification\077 You qualify if your adjusted gross income\054 as determined by your most recently filed Individual Income Tax return \050Form 1040\051 or your household\220s gross monthly income from Form 433\055A\050OIC\051 x 12\054 is equal to or less than the amount shown in the chart below based on your family size and where you live\056 If you qualify\054 you are not required to submit any payments or the application fee upon submission or during the consideration of your  offer\056 If your business is other than a sole proprietor or disregarded single member LLC taxed as a sole proprietor and you owe employment taxes on or after January 1\054 2009\054 you cannot qualify for Low\055Income Certification\056 The IRS will verify whether you qualify for Low\055Income Certification\056 I qualify for the Low\055Income Certification because my adjusted gross income for my household\047s size is equal to or less than the amount shown in the table below\056)
/Type /Annot
/V /Off
>>
